   "source": [
    " # Executive Summary"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "376195c0-b7ed-4319-8e4f-c4f3b9a851e5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "This project analyzed customer churn behavior in a telecom company using customer segmentation and machine learning techniques."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8cdeb00b-e969-44a6-8cdb-467d271b098c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Key Findings"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "b6b7f50a-9468-48e3-aa63-a195cf42ecd2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "New customers showed the highest churn rate (~48%).\n",
    "Month-to-month contracts had significantly higher churn than yearly contracts.\n",
    "Customers without Tech Support were more likely to leave.\n",
    "Competitor offers were the leading reason for churn.\n",
    "Contract type, Internet Service, and Tenure were the strongest predictors of churn.\n",
    "Best Model"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "adf57e10-47d4-424e-99e0-d862f79c47cc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Best Model"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "325dec49-227c-4747-9746-49fb14d561f1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "XGBoost Accuracy: 80.24%\n",
    "Balanced Logistic Recall: 78%"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "725815cc-4d2c-4819-b408-9441ab6becf5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Business Recommendations"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "613cec81-c845-4bc1-952c-9ac36d092c7f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Convert month-to-month customers into annual plans.\n",
    "Improve onboarding during the first year.\n",
    "Strengthen Tech Support services.\n",
    "Offer retention incentives to high-risk customers."
   ]
  },
  {
